g with industry-leading drug and alcohol testing, creating a seamless system for managing employee data and ensuring compliance with workplace safety protocols.<br><br>With this partnership, you get a unified platform that simplifies workforce management, reduces risks, and improves operational transparency.</span></p><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-dGCntx NmQIv pf-23_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-24_ pf-heading-1-h2"><first-sel>How it Works</first-sel></h2><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-26_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-32f58190-a371-43c8-aef6-f16e2ec3e4e8"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">The integration between the <strong>Andatech Soberlive FRX breathalyser</strong>&nbsp;and <strong>Aussie Time Sheets</strong> makes managing workplace safety and attendance seamless. Staff can clock in and out for work while also completing a quick, contactless breath test—all in one step.</span></p></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-29_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-30_"><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:15px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eifsgl epDHtf pf-31_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fKWLGC lflwGM pf-32_"><strong>Clocking In<br></strong>The employee walks up to the Soberlive FRX unit and identifies themselves using facial recognition or their staff RFID card.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fKWLGC lflwGM pf-34_"><strong>Taking the Breath Test<br></strong>They then provide a quick, contactless breath sample using the wall-mounted breathalyser.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fKWLGC lflwGM pf-36_"><strong>Automatic Data Sync<br></strong>In under 5 seconds, the system records the employee’s identity, breath test result, and the time of the test.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fKWLGC lflwGM pf-38_"><strong>Integration with Aussie Time Sheets<br></strong>All this data is automatically sent to Aussie Time Sheets, where it’s logged under the employee’s profile for real-time tracking and compliance.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fKWLGC lflwGM pf-40_"><strong>Clocking Out<br></strong>At the end of the workday, the employee repeats the same process to clock out—quick, simple, and secure.</li></ul></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-42_"><img alt="Andatech Soberlive FRX wall mounted breathalyser with facial recognition and door access control" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Soberlive.jpg?v=1697676498&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" width="1080" height="1080" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-dWZrec jpHayX pf-43_" store="[object Object]"/></div></div></div><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-44_ pf-heading-1-h2"><first-sel>Integration Features</first-sel></h2><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-46_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-2ec3e4e8-fddb-41f6-9c2e-0975e2f09184"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">With Andatech’s contactless technology and Aussie Time Sheets’ smart integration, workplaces can ensure both accurate attendance tracking and daily safety checks—all in one streamlined workflow.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-49_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-50_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-dycZeM bYnQgk pf-51_"><path d="M246.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-128-128c-9.2-9.2-22.9-11.9-34.9-6.9s-19.8 16.6-19.8 29.6l0 256c0 12.9 7.8 24.6 19.8 29.6s25.7 2.2 34.9-6.9l128-128z"></path></svg><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-52_ pf-heading-3-h3">Automated Time <br>Tracking and Testing</h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-54_"><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-55_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-a8d1fc15-6341-40d2-bde5-8a3eae6f40d0"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Andatech’s certified alcohol breathalysers integrate effortlessly with Aussie Time Sheets' time and attendance systems.<br><br>Employees’ time logs and test results are automatically synced for accuracy and efficiency.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-58_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-59_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-dycZeM bYnQgk pf-60_"><path d="M246.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-128-128c-9.2-9.2-22.9-11.9-34.9-6.9s-19.8 16.6-19.8 29.6l0 256c0 12.9 7.8 24.6 19.8 29.6s25.7 2.2 34.9-6.9l128-128z"></path></svg><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-61_ pf-heading-3-h3">Real-Time Data<br>Synchronisation</h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-63_"><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-64_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-0c36bba4-dc6b-4322-814e-83129bfd9b11"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Test results and attendance data are synced live, providing managers immediate access to vital information.<br><br>Managers can generate necessary reports for compliance and performance analysis.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-67_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-68_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-dycZeM bYnQgk pf-69_"><path d="M246.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-128-128c-9.2-9.2-22.9-11.9-34.9-6.9s-19.8 16.6-19.8 29.6l0 256c0 12.9 7.8 24.6 19.8 29.6s25.7 2.2 34.9-6.9l128-128z"></path></svg><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-70_ pf-heading-3-h3">Centralised Data<br>Management with Andalink</h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-72_"><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-73_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ccc2c26a-b490-4ba3-a745-d27556c8f39d"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Using Andalink, Andatech’s cloud-based platform, testing data from multiple sites can be consolidated.<br><br>Companies can monitor safety compliance and manage reporting from a single, centralised hub.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-76_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-77_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-dycZeM bYnQgk pf-78_"><path d="M246.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-128-128c-9.2-9.2-22.9-11.9-34.9-6.9s-19.8 16.6-19.8 29.6l0 256c0 12.9 7.8 24.6 19.8 29.6s25.7 2.2 34.9-6.9l128-128z"></path></svg><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-79_ pf-heading-3-h3">Compliance with<br>Workplace Safety Protocols</h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-81_"><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-82_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ac185358-da7a-4303-8fc7-3a1922535e0f"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Easily ensure your business meets drug and alcohol safety regulations.<br><br>Gain access to exception alerts, detailed records, and comprehensive reporting for audits.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-85_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-86_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-dycZeM bYnQgk pf-87_"><path d="M246.6 278.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-128-128c-9.2-9.2-22.9-11.9-34.9-6.9s-19.8 16.6-19.8 29.6l0 256c0 12.9 7.8 24.6 19.8 29.6s25.7 2.2 34.9-6.9l128-128z"></path></svg><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-88_ pf-heading-3-h3">Customisable<br>Configuration</h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-90_"><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-91_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-07ea0c68-266a-4f3b-bdb2-f4d9079cee82"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Tailor the integration to meet workplace needs, such as scheduling tests or managing employee policies.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-94_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--s-md:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:5;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-95_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kRRxPL kSaugo pf-96_ pf-heading-2-h2">Flexible Workforce Management Solutions</h2><p class="sc-EROOM ZMPII pf-98_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5d875fcf-5f68-41b9-a8b1-edb864f3b921"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Our partnership with Aussie Time Sheets brings a powerful, end-to-end workforce management and alcohol testing solution to your business. By integrating the Andatech Soberlive FRX breathalyser with Aussie Time Sheets software, businesses can automate and streamline their alcohol testing processes—ensuring a safer and more compliant workplace. <br><br>Solutions available from Aussie Time Sheets include:&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:7;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-101_"><img alt="Andatech Soberlive FRX breathalyser and Aussie Time Sheets integration.png__PID:55511544-b88a-4035-b9a6-8d868cec56c2" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Andatech_Soberlive_FRX_breathalyser_and_Aussie_Time_Sheets_integration.png?v=1745479505&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Andatech_Soberlive_FRX_breathalyser_and_Aussie_Time_Sheets_integration.png?v=1745479505&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0241/5850/2976/files/Andatech_Soberlive_FRX_br